s (including <em>Nature</em> and <em>Science</em>) over a career of 20+ years. His webinars and in-person seminars around the world continue to educate and encourage researchers on writing, methodology, ethics, and emerging trends such as generative AI. He is uniquely skilled in program design and delivery for non-native English speakers, and always brings compassion and flexibility. Dr. Dyke is UK-born and based in Europe.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-svc-note","_title":"Biography"},"elements":[]},{"id":"ab3cd3","elType":"widget","widgetType":"button","settings":{"text":"LinkedIn","link":{"url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/garethdyke/","is_external":"on","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":"","label":""},"selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-external-link-alt","library":"fa-solid"},"icon_align":"left","icon_indent":{"unit":"px","size":8,"sizes":[]},"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.72,"sizes":[]},"button_type":"","text_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_css_classes":"ml-arrow-link ml-i-arw ml-person-link ml-btn-link","_title":"Profile link"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"ac533a","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"26","right":"26","bottom":"26","left":"26","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"css_classes":"ml-card ml-person ml-reveal ml-reveal-1","_title":"Scott McCleary, MEd"},"elements":[{"id":"abf66d","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"row","flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"12","column":"12","row":"12","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"css_classes":"ml-quote-who ml-person-who","_title":"Who"},"elements":[{"id":"ab7ab1","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"id":2292,"url":"https://staging1.macrolingo.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/scott.jpg","alt":"Scott McCleary, MEd","source":"library","size":""},"image_size":"full","_css_classes":"ml-quote-avatar","_title":"Portrait"},"elements":[]},{"id":"abd77e","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_title":"Name and role"},"elements":[{"id":"ab99a0","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Scott McCleary, MEd","header_size":"h4","_css_classes":"ml-quote-name","_title":"Name"},"elements":[]},{"id":"abb88f","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Online learning</p>","_css_classes":"ml-person-role","_title":"What they do"},"elements":[]}]}]},{"id":"ac155c","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Scott McCleary is a learning and development specialist with 20+ years of experience formulating and implementing training programs for scientific professionals and scholars. He has delivered training for more than 100 organizations worldwide, including Sony, Nissan, Toshiba, Deutsche Bank, Mitsubishi, Skandia Insurance, Bombardier, Benesse, and the National Medical Center of Japan. As a specialist in online education, Scott delivers a teaching approach with design sensibility and technological knowhow.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-svc-note","_title":"Biography"},"elements":[]},{"id":"ac344b","elType":"widget","widgetType":"button","settings":{"text":"LinkedIn","link":{"url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/scottmccleary/","is_external":"on","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":"","label":""},"selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-external-link-alt","library":"fa-solid"},"icon_align":"left","icon_indent":{"unit":"px","size":8,"sizes":[]},"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.72,"sizes":[]},"button_type":"","text_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_css_classes":"ml-arrow-link ml-i-arw ml-person-link ml-btn-link","_title":"Profile link"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"ad4ab2","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"26","right":"26","bottom":"26","left":"26","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"css_classes":"ml-card ml-person ml-reveal ml-reveal-2","_title":"Adam Goulston, PsyD, MBA"},"elements":[{"id":"acede5","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"row","flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"12","column":"12","row":"12","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"css_classes":"ml-quote-who ml-person-who","_title":"Who"},"elements":[{"id":"ac7229","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"id":1411,"url":"https://staging1.macrolingo.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Adam-MacroLingo.jpg","alt":"Adam Goulston, PsyD, MBA","source":"library","size":""},"image_size":"full","_css_classes":"ml-quote-avatar","_title":"Portrait"},"elements":[]},{"id":"accef6","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_title":"Name and role"},"elements":[{"id":"ac9118","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Adam Goulston, PsyD, MBA","header_size":"h4","_css_classes":"ml-quote-name","_title":"Name"},"elements":[]},{"id":"acb007","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Content and AI search</p>","_css_classes":"ml-person-role","_title":"What they do"},"elements":[]}]}]},{"id":"ad0cd4","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>A trained journalist and professional editor who branched out into translation and academic editing, Dr. Adam Goulston is a world leader in expert-driven content for academic and scientific purposes. He continues to craft search engine-leading articles using a unique B2B + B2C approach for science. He has also edited 2,000+ scientific manuscripts and written hundreds of press releases, in addition to planning and commissioning search engine-minded (AI-SEO) web design and content for science. Dr. Goulston is US-born and based in Japan.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-svc-note","_title":"Biography"},"elements":[]},{"id":"ad2bc3","elType":"widget","widgetType":"button","settings":{"text":"LinkedIn","link":{"url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/adamgoulston/","is_external":"on","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":"","label":""},"selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-external-link-alt","library":"fa-solid"},"icon_align":"left","icon_indent":{"unit":"px","size":8,"sizes":[]},"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.72,"sizes":[]},"button_type":"","text_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_css_classes":"ml-arrow-link ml-i-arw ml-person-link ml-btn-link","_title":"Profile link"},"elements":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"b08de7","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"92","right":"30","bottom":"92","left":"30","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"56","right":"30","bottom":"56","left":"30","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"stretch","_element_id":"faq","css_classes":"ml-inner","_title":"FAQ"},"elements":[{"id":"ae422a","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"stretch","width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"css_classes":"ml-section-head ml-reveal","_title":"Section heading"},"elements":[{"id":"ae044c","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Frequently asked questions","header_size":"h6","align":"center","_css_classes":"ml-label ml-label-centred","_title":"Label"},"elements":[]},{"id":"ae233b","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Questions about <span class=\"ml-highlight\">Academia services</span>","header_size":"h2","align":"center","_title":"Heading","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"b06ef8","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"46","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"flex_align_items":"stretch","css_classes":"ml-faq-cols","_title":"Questions"},"elements":[{"id":"af7780","elType":"widget","widgetType":"nested-accordion","settings":{"items":[{"_id":"ae6119","item_title":"What are your qualifications?"},{"_id":"aebde6","item_title":"How does payment work?"},{"_id":"af1ab3","item_title":"How will we know it is working?"}],"title_tag":"h3","default_state":"all_collapsed","max_items_expended":"multiple","title_typography_typography":"custom","title_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18.5,"sizes":[]},"title_typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.72,"sizes":[]},"icon_size":{"unit":"px","size":24,"sizes":[]},"_css_classes":"ml-faq ml-reveal","_title":"Questions, left"},"elements":[{"id":"ae9ef7","elType":"container","settings":{"_title":"What are your qualifications?"},"elements":[{"id":"ae8008","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Our seminars are done in cooperation with Sci-Train, led by Gareth Dyke, PhD, an academic publishing influencer and an author on over 300 published articles, together with Scott McCleary, MEd, an education technology expert who has implemented 100+ training courses for major corporations and academic institutions.</p><p>Dr. Adam Goulston, owner of MacroLingo, is a BELS-certified scientific editor, has worked with several academic publishers and author-guidance companies, and brings a business-to-science perspective based on 25+ years in writing, journalism, and research.</p>","_title":"Answer","__globals__":{"text_color":"globals/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"aefbc4","elType":"container","settings":{"_title":"How does payment work?"},"elements":[{"id":"aedcd5","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>First, we like to know about your financial ability and your specific aims. We also want to try our best to encourage you if you are from the Global South or face any sort of budgetary constraints. After we consider your situation, we may request full or partial payment in advance (especially for seminars and learning), or a monthly retainer arrangement paid upon job completion may be better for you. Let us discuss it and find a way to make it work for you.</p>","_title":"Answer","__globals__":{"text_color":"globals/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"af5891","elType":"container","settings":{"_title":"How will we know it is working?"},"elements":[{"id":"af39a2","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>You should see fewer &ldquo;basic&rdquo; mistakes at intake, fewer repetitive questions, and fewer submissions rejected because authors missed scope or instructions. Your author-facing pages should read like clear guidance, not policy text.</p>","_title":"Answer","__globals__":{"text_color":"globals/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[]}]}]},{"id":"b05009","elType":"widget","widgetType":"nested-accordion","settings":{"items":[{"_id":"af966f","item_title":"Can you do one-off or single seminars?"},{"_id":"aff33c","item_title":"What does content have to do with seminars?"}],"title_tag":"h3","default_state":"all_collapsed","max_items_expended":"multiple","title_typography_typography":"custom","title_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18.5,"sizes":[]},"title_typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.72,"sizes":[]},"icon_size":{"unit":"px","size":24,"sizes":[]},"_css_classes":"ml-faq ml-reveal ml-reveal-1","_title":"Questions, right"},"elements":[{"id":"afd44d","elType":"container","settings":{"_title":"Can you do one-off or single seminars?"},"elements":[{"id":"afb55e","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>A series of sessions is usually necessary to truly guide and achieve learning. However, sometimes a single session is what is required, such as for researchers in a particular subject area or for new peer reviewers. We can arrange those as well.</p>","_title":"Answer","__globals__":{"text_color":"globals/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"b0311a","elType":"container","settings":{"_title":"What does content have to do with seminars?"},"elements":[{"id":"b0122b","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>As content director for multiple companies, Dr. Dyke was called on to produce educational materials in the form of seminars and webinars as well as written material in the form of web content, blogs and so on. He also commissioned visuals. For the written aspects, Dr. Dyke and Dr. Goulston are frequent collaborators, as companies and organizations often want a combination of educational and marketing-oriented materials. This lets us offer a unique combination of academia and business knowledge in one content package.</p>","_title":"Answer","__globals__":{"text_color":"globals/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[]}]}]}]}]},{"id":"b3b22d","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"92","right":"30","bottom":"92","left":"30","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"56","right":"30","bottom":"56","left":"30","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLin